# The wrapper, rescued from *.jar above — and it has to come after it, because the last
# pattern that matches a path is the one that decides. Un-anchored because the wrappers live
# under backend/ and android/, not beside this file. A build whose wrapper jar is missing
# cannot bootstrap itself at all, which is the whole point of committing one.
!**/gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar
!**/gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.properties

